<title>USA: AGCO sees $0.10-$0.15/shr impact on 2nd half.</title>
<headline>AGCO sees $0.10-$0.15/shr impact on 2nd half.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>AGCO Corp said Thursday it expects the cost of restructuring its newly-acquired Brazilian operations will hurt its third and fourth quarter earnings.</p>
<p>The company said the negative impact on the second half is estimated at $0.10 to $0.15 per share.</p>
<p>The agricultural equipment manufacturer said the restructuring includes significant cost reductions of about $15 million and should be achieved by year-end.</p>
<p>It said the restructuring includes &quot;headcount reductions&quot; but did not give a specific number.</p>
</text>
